  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-r76i8ReR\">API授权是以User为纬度的，Access Token记录了授权User信息；通过此接口可以获取每一个Access Token对应的User信息，方便开发者区分以及管理对应授权关系；</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201801717012517962%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-KQEJkUZb\" id=\"link-0\">请求地址</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-lWYbXrK2\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/user/info/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/user/info/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1697819831388174\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-VgY4NZge\" id=\"link-1\">请求方法</h5><p data-id=\"p838747a-kiIaNUFX\">GET</p><h5 data-id=\"h7723ecd-SPePYB90\" id=\"link-2\">请求Header</h5><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t844fe7d-VlFl6xEF\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; outline: none; border-c